{"id":"e297a38eede15144","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-ax-equality-reflexivity.md","title":"Equality Reflexivity Axiom Scheme","display":"ax-equality-reflexivity — Equality Reflexivity Axiom Scheme","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-equality-reflexivity","aliases":["58-ax-equality-reflexivity"],"display":"ax-equality-reflexivity — Equality Reflexivity Axiom Scheme","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-equality-reflexivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-equality-reflexivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-equality-reflexivity — Equality Reflexivity Axiom Scheme"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> are the term and atomic-formula code sets from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\">\\(E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> is the set of equality-reflexivity axiom instances defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(t\\doteq t\\in E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(t\\doteq t\\in E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed expressions are object-language formula codes. The scheme places every code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq t\">\\(t\\doteq t\\)</span> in the equality theory; it does not confuse that code with a metatheoretic assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ and $\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)$ are the term and atomic-formula code sets from [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}equality\\text{-}reflexivity}\\vdash\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(t\\doteq t\\in E_{=}^{\\mathrm{refl}}(\\Sigma)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"t\\doteq t","display":false}],"bytes":1162,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-ax-equality-reflexivity.md|58-ax-equality-reflexivity]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}